          "text": " Antony, this is not Brutus, friend, but I assure you a prize no less in worth. Keep this man safe, give him all kindness. I had rather have such men my friends than enemies. Go on, and see whether Brutus be alive or dead, and bring us word unto Octavius' tent how everything is chanked.",
